@startuml US_3_2_6_C4_Processos
title US 3.2.6 - Processo detalhado de ativação

actor User
participant Start as "/activation/start"
participant IAM as "IAM Provider (OIDC)"
participant Confirm as "/activation/confirm"
participant Service as "ActivationLinkService"
database DB as "PortContext"

User -> Start: GET with token
Start -> Start: valida token hash/expiração
Start -> IAM: Challenge (PKCE)
IAM --> Confirm: redirect with code/tokens
Confirm -> Service: RedeemAsync(token, sub/email)
Service -> DB: marcar token redeemed\nset AppUser.Active=true\nsalvar ExternalId/Name
DB --> Service: ok/fail
alt ok
  Confirm --> User: redirect frontend ?activation=success
else mismatch/expirado
  Confirm --> User: página de erro
end

@enduml
